OL,3,CThames Water among suppliers set to be
OL,4,Callowed to hike bills to boost spending
OL,6,FStricken Thames Water is among five
OL,7,Fwater firms given the provisional go-
OL,8,Fahead by the industry watchdog to hike
OL,9,Fbills further as part of plans
OL,10,Fallowing suppliers to spend an extra
OL,11,F#3.4 billion.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
