OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786637919
OL,3,CThames Water among suppliers set to be
OL,4,Callowed to hike bills to boost spending
OL,6,FOfwat revealed in its draft
OL,7,Fdetermination that five of 13
OL,8,Fsuppliers across England and Wales are
OL,9,Fset to be given permission to increase
OL,10,Fcharges for customers to pump in the
OL,11,Fadditional investment by the end of
OL,12,Fthe decade to help upgrade networks to
OL,13,Fcope with new housing and data centres
OL,14,Fand tackle forever chemicals to ensure
OL,15,Fdrinking water is safe and reliable.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
