PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786637919
OL,3,CThames Water among suppliers set to be
OL,4,Callowed to hike bills to boost spending
OL,6,FDebt-laden Thames Water is one of the
OL,7,Ffirms provisionally allowed to
OL,8,Fincrease customer bills between 2027
OL,9,Fand 2030, alongside Severn Trent
OL,10,FWater, Southern Water, Wessex Water
OL,11,Fand South East Water.
OL,13,FIt follows a three-month review by
OL,14,FOfwat, with the 13 firms originally
OL,15,Fputting forward requests for further
OL,16,Finvestment of #4.3 billion.
OL,18,FOfwat will now consult on the draft
OL,19,Fdecision until September 24 with a
OL,20,Ffinal verdict due in December.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
