CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786637919
OL,3,CThames Water among suppliers set to be
OL,4,Callowed to hike bills to boost spending
OL,6,FHelen Campbell, executive director for
OL,7,Fdelivery at Ofwat, said: "The newly
OL,8,Fagreed funding will help unlock much-
OL,9,Fneeded new housing development and
OL,10,Fboost business growth across a range
OL,11,Fof sectors, as well as improving
OL,12,Fdrinking water quality and the removal
OL,13,Fof PFAS and forever chemicals.
OL,15,F"We will track performance to ensure
OL,16,Fcompanies are delivering the expected
OL,17,Fimprovements for customers and the
OL,18,Fenvironment. If they don't,
OL,19,Fexpenditure can be clawed back."
